        {
          "text": "Zonke izenzo zamandla akhe, namandla akhe, nesimemezelo sobukhulu bukaMoridekayi, inkosi eyamkhulisa ngabo, angithi kulotshiwe encwadini yezindaba zemihla ngemihla yamakhosi aseMediya nasePheresiya?",
