        {
          "text": "Ngokuba uMoridekayi, umJuda, wayengowesibili kwenkosi u-Ahashiveroshi, emkhulu phakathi kwabaJuda, wathokozisa uquqaba lwabafowabo, wafuna ingcebo yabantu bakhe, wakhuluma ukuthula kuyo yonke inzalo yakhe.",
